lor:#475569;font-size:10px;font-weight:700;\">Reset</button><button style=\"flex:1;padding:7px;border-radius:8px;background:#7c3aed;border:none;color:#fff;font-size:10px;font-weight:700;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(124,58,237,.25);\">Apply Filters</button></div></div>"
